{"id":"aa16587cad992289","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-realadd.md","title":"Addition on Reals","display":"df-realadd — Addition on Reals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-realadd","aliases":["58-df-realadd"],"display":"df-realadd — Addition on Reals","depends_on":["[[58-df-dedekind-cut]]","[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-realadd"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-realadd</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-realadd — Addition on Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"37d8cf418a7b6598\" href=\"?note=37d8cf418a7b6598\" title=\"58-df-dedekind-cut\">58-df-dedekind-cut</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-reals.md\">../batch02/58-df-reals.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c54af6fc6a780954\" href=\"?note=c54af6fc6a780954\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-reals.md\">../batch02/58-df-reals.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{\\mathbb Q}:\\mathbb Q^2\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(+_{\\mathbb Q}:\\mathbb Q^2\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span>（有理数加法；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"21c0965b79ed66aa\" href=\"?note=21c0965b79ed66aa\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-rational.md\">../batch13/58-df-rational.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{\\mathbb R}:\\mathbb R^2\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(+_{\\mathbb R}:\\mathbb R^2\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span>（本文件定义的 Dedekind 切加法）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}realadd} \\vdash x+_{\\mathbb R}y \\coloneqq \\{r\\in\\mathbb Q:\\exists p\\in x\\;\\exists q\\in y\\;(r=p+_{\\mathbb Q}q)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}realadd} \\vdash x+_{\\mathbb R}y \\coloneqq \\{r\\in\\mathbb Q:\\exists p\\in x\\;\\exists q\\in y\\;(r=p+_{\\mathbb Q}q)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>左侧与右侧的加法现分属实数切运算和有理数域运算，消除了同一符号在定义两侧的层级歧义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-dedekind-cut","status":"resolved","id":"37d8cf418a7b6598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dedekind-cut]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-reals.md","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79ed66aa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-rational.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-reals.md","status":"resolved","id":"c54af6fc6a780954","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb R$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-reals.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-rational.md","status":"resolved","id":"21c0965b79